Roster management panes: Contracts, Salary sheets, Members, Access & imports. Members is where staff expand or shrink the seat count. A seat is the slot; a manager is the person. Chat is `FantasyChatDock`: a flush edge launcher parked on an edge (expands on hover) you can drag to a new edge that opens a side drawer. Not a pane. The full thread lives on Home as a locker rail. Do not show the launcher on Home. Do not rotate its type. Do not add a Chat destination. On phone the launcher defaults to the bottom-right above the tab bar, the dismiss control sits on the bubble, and filter/tab/sort bars use the Insights sticky strip (`.hub-page-sticky`). Summary labels stack above values. Clear chat is staff-only, red, and confirms.

